WEBVTT

00:00:53.912 --> 00:01:00.454
And slowly restoring this house piece by
piece became his ritual for years,

00:01:00.704 --> 00:01:03.746
nonstop every Saturday
throughout the year.

00:01:03.746 --> 00:01:05.621
Just some project that
would take, you know,

00:01:05.621 --> 00:01:10.371
years to figure out he would just kind of
chip away at even after Michael left

00:01:10.371 --> 00:01:16.996
for college and moved abroad until 2004,
I got a call from my mother

00:01:18.788 --> 00:01:20.704
that my father was very sick with cancer,

00:01:20.704 --> 00:01:25.621
that I had to come back in order to be
with him on undefined death watch,

00:01:25.621 --> 00:01:27.954
we might say, hit about three
weeks to live, they told us.

00:01:28.204 --> 00:01:31.038
And he was only 52 years old.
Is that right?